---
type: company
name: {{ name | yaml }}
score: {{ score | default(0) }}
action_cluster: {{ action_cluster | default("Watchlist") | yaml }}
domain_cluster: {{ domain_cluster | default("General Tech & Services") | yaml }}
target_tier: {{ target_tier | default("Standard") | yaml }}
job_count: {{ jobs|length }}
connection_count: {{ people|length }}
industry: {{ industry | yaml }}
location: {{ location | yaml }}
website: {{ website | yaml }}
status: {{ status | default("new") | yaml }}
tags:
  - company
  - {{ (action_cluster or "Watchlist") | replace(' ', '_') }}
  - {{ (domain_cluster or "General") | replace(' ', '_') }}
---
# {{ name }} (Score: {{ score | default(0) }}/100)

> [!INFO] **Action Tier: {{ action_cluster | default("Watchlist") }}** · **Domain: {{ domain_cluster | default("General Tech") }}** · **Tier: {{ target_tier | default("Standard") }}**
> **Directive:** {{ recommended_action | default("Review opportunities and network.") }}

## Score Breakdown
- **Job Opportunity Quality (45%):** {{ breakdown.job_fit_score | default(0) }}/100
- **Company Profile & Domain Fit (35%):** {{ breakdown.company_fit_score | default(0) }}/100
- **Network Leverage (20%):** {{ breakdown.network_score | default(0) }}/100

## Action Checklist
{% if action_cluster == "Warm Outreach" %}
- [ ] 1. Review network contacts below and select primary referral candidate.
- [ ] 2. Send personalized LinkedIn referral request message.
- [ ] 3. After referral submission or intro, submit tailored application for target role.
{% elif action_cluster == "Direct Apply" %}
- [ ] 1. Submit application directly via company careers portal.
- [ ] 2. Identify engineering manager / technical recruiter on LinkedIn.
- [ ] 3. Send direct follow-up message referencing applied role.
{% elif action_cluster == "Network Nurture" %}
- [ ] 1. Send friendly check-in or informational chat request to connection.
- [ ] 2. Keep resume / profile updated for upcoming openings.
{% else %}
- [ ] Monitor career page periodically for matching roles.
{% endif %}

## Open Opportunities
{% for job in jobs %}
- [[{{ job.filename }}|{{ job.title }}]] ({{ job.status }}){% if job.score %} · Match Score: **{{ job.score }}**{% endif %}{% if job.link %} · [Apply Link]({{ job.link }}){% endif %}
{% else %}
- No open jobs currently in cache.
{% endfor %}

## Network & Referral Contacts
{% for person in people %}
- [[{{ person.filename }}|{{ person.name }}]] - {{ person.title }}{% if person.role_type and person.role_type != 'other' %} `[{{ person.role_type|upper }}]`{% endif %}
{% else %}
- No direct connections found at this company.
{% endfor %}

## Notes
